{
  "_meta": {
    "title": "LTX VFX: Ripple edit (IC-LoRA LTX Ripple v1.1)",
    "description": "Core ComfyUI nodes only (LTX-2.5 support in ComfyUI core). Distilled LTX-2.5 22B (int8), 8 fixed sigmas, euler_ancestral, cfg 1 (LTXVDualCFGGuider 1/1). IC-LoRA (First Frame All Frames): LoraLoaderModelOnly (strength 1.35, card) -> GetICLoRAParameters -> LTXVAddGuide(frame_idx 0, strength 1) on a reference built like the card workflow: the edited first frame (LoadImage, scaled to the clip size) followed by the source frames, cut back to the clip length (ImageBatch + ImageFromBatch). The LoRA carries the first-frame edit through the whole shot; motion, timing and camera come from the source. Source audio kept. LTXVCropGuides drops the guide frames before decoding. LTX-2.x Community License (ltx-2.x-community-license)."
  },
